          "quote": "have significant negative impacts on our financial condition and operations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Fuel supply and availability volatility has in the past and may in the future lead to increased fuel costs and reduced profitability.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "chunk_id": "CCL-000081509726000007-0081",
          "quote": "The supply and availability of different fuel types in various markets in which we operate have in the past and may in the future experience increased volatility"
