          "quote": "Overcapacity and competition in the cruise and land-based vacation industry may negatively impact our cruise sales, pricing and destination options"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "qualitative",
      "text": "Sustainability and emissions-related regulatory activity may require capital investments in new equipment or technologies, payment for emission allowances, purchases of carbon offset credits or other additional costs, and may increase operating costs.",
      "citations": [
